  "notes": {
    "raw": "Phase change: 933.61 K, melting point of Al; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.580$ kcal/mol \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{0} = 14.610 + 0.196 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.241 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=14.610\\times10^{-3}T+0.098\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+1.241\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-4.781$ \nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-933.61 K: $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = 39.085 + 1.254 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 3.516 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 124.750 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 39.085 - 1.254 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 3.516 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 62.375 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 17.012 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \n933.61-2000 K: $\\Delta Hr^{0} = 36.550 - 4.742 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.062 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 89.950 T^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 36.550 + 4.742 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.062 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 44.975 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 52.058 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \nSource: Data from Gurvich (50). ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "Phase change: 933.61 K, melting point of Al; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.580$ kcal/mol",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{0} = 14.610 + 0.196 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.241 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$",
      "$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=14.610\\times10^{-3}T+0.098\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+1.241\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-4.781$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "298.15-933.61 K: $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = 39.085 + 1.254 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 3.516 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 124.750 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 39.085 - 1.254 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 3.516 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 62.375 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 17.012 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "933.61-2000 K: $\\Delta Hr^{0} = 36.550 - 4.742 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.062 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 89.950 T^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 36.550 + 4.742 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.062 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 44.975 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 52.058 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
